rch_2026.pdf?v=1.0) https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Shareholding/2025-26/Shareholding_Pattern_March_2026.pdf?v=1.0)\nDisclosures Regulation 46 62 SEBI LODR 2015 Familiarisation FY 2025 26 https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/bod/Familiarisation-Programme-FY2025-26.pdf?v=1.0) pdf icon https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/bod/Familiarisation-Programme-FY2025-26.pdf?v=1.0) 2024 25 https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/bod/Familiarisation-Programme.pdf?v=1.0) https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/bod/Familiarisation-Programme.pdf?v=1.0) Details https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/about-us.aspx) arrow https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/arrow_685136.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/about-us.aspx)\nCorporate Announcements FY 2026 2027FY 2025 2026FY 2024 2025FY 2023 2024FY 2022 2023FY 2021 Disclosure Earnings Transcript Q1 FY2026 27 https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2026-27/Disclosure-Earnings-Call-Transcript-Q1-FY-2026-27.pdf?v=1.1) pdf icon https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/images/pdf-icon-blue.svg)](https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2026-27/Disclosure-Earnings-Call-Transcript-Q1-FY-2026-27.pdf?v=1.1) Newspaper Publication Financial Results https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/Corporate-Announcements/2026-27/Newspaper-Publication-of-Financial-Results_Q1_FY-2026-27.pdf?v=1.1)"}}}</sources>
